WEBVTT

01:38.680 --> 01:40.160
Your Highness, are you saying

01:40.240 --> 01:42.280
you want my soldiers
pretend to be from Nanzhao,

01:42.360 --> 01:43.240
then fight against themselves?

01:46.000 --> 01:48.160
I am but a regular prince
with no actual power.

01:48.240 --> 01:49.760
I do not have my own army.

01:50.880 --> 01:52.520
Thus, General Niu,

01:52.600 --> 01:55.080
I trust that you shall
muster sufficient forces

01:55.160 --> 01:56.400
and see to this matter personally.

01:58.680 --> 02:00.560
What exactly do you want?

02:02.840 --> 02:05.040
I want you as an ally.

02:05.880 --> 02:08.320
Naturally,
this is an assault on the city, after all.

02:08.400 --> 02:10.199
There shall be spoils of war to divide.

02:10.280 --> 02:13.560
By chance,
I have certain belongings left in Yizhou.

02:13.640 --> 02:16.840
General Niu, I trust that you might
see them safely returned to me.

02:17.760 --> 02:19.400
What you truly desire

02:19.480 --> 02:22.520
are the skilled artisans
of Yizhou's brocade industry, is it not?

02:25.000 --> 02:28.160
This is why I say that you know me best.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.920
Yizhou has long been a cradle of talent.

02:31.000 --> 02:33.080
So long as Huanhua Creek exists,
and so long as you remain,

02:33.160 --> 02:34.920
its gifted artisans will persist,

02:35.840 --> 02:38.520
rising stronger with each setback.

02:38.600 --> 02:43.280
Yet, this chance you have now
is but once in a lifetime.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.320
Let me caution you, General Niu.

03:02.400 --> 03:05.640
Indulge as you may, but do not overstep.

03:05.720 --> 03:07.360
To go too far
would only sow seeds of discord,

03:07.440 --> 03:09.560
deep and lasting,

03:09.640 --> 03:10.960
between Datang and Nanzhao.

03:11.040 --> 03:12.440
Such a rift wouldn't be good.

03:12.520 --> 03:13.920
Worry not, Prince Bai.

03:14.680 --> 03:18.240
It is my own city.
I would not bear to destroy it.

03:18.320 --> 03:19.400
Very well.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.400
How comforting it is
to have someone to long for.

03:33.480 --> 03:34.400
No matter how far your journey takes you,

03:34.480 --> 03:36.000
home will always remain where you left it,
waiting steadfastly for your return.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.120
You are envious of me?

03:47.960 --> 03:48.920
General Xue.

03:51.720 --> 03:52.560
This…

03:57.840 --> 04:00.280
The commissioner is busy.
He is not able to see you for now.

04:00.800 --> 04:02.720
Just rest easy and wait here.

04:05.120 --> 04:06.760
I am now a fugitive.

04:07.280 --> 04:10.160
The commissioner
would do well to tread cautiously.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.000
Fret not.

04:13.560 --> 04:15.360
The day will come
when your name shall be cleared.

04:16.480 --> 04:18.600
I am in no haste to clear my name.

04:18.680 --> 04:22.520
However, Prince Bai
has met with Niu Jin in Yizhou.

04:22.600 --> 04:24.000
With Niu Jin commanding an army
at his disposal,

04:24.080 --> 04:27.080
their alliance would surely
lead to a disastrous misstep.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.600
I can only hope the commissioner
makes his decision without further delay.

04:29.680 --> 04:31.920
It is precisely because of Niu Jin's army

04:32.440 --> 04:35.520
that the commissioner cannot act in haste.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.600
Just wait here patiently.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.280
General Xue.

05:04.480 --> 05:06.920
No. I must make a trip back to Yizhou.

05:11.800 --> 05:13.560
You were just caught
and now you want to run again?

05:15.680 --> 05:17.960
The commissioner surely has his reasons
for keeping watch at this time.

05:18.040 --> 05:19.240
I, too, must make my own preparations.

05:19.320 --> 05:22.640
Fang, I must trouble you
to serve as a hostage.

05:22.720 --> 05:24.560
Help me pass a message
to the commissioner.

05:24.640 --> 05:25.840
If Yizhou remains safe,

05:25.920 --> 05:28.160
I shall return swiftly
to face my punishment.

05:29.280 --> 05:31.680
You must return soon.
I am not happy staying here.

05:32.880 --> 05:33.800
Worry not.

05:33.880 --> 05:36.040
Wait for me to come back.
I will bring wine for you.

05:45.920 --> 05:49.600
Take any chance to run.

05:50.640 --> 05:52.360
Forget about the rest.

05:53.920 --> 05:54.880
Remember,

05:55.880 --> 05:58.040
even if you must humble yourself
and submit,

05:58.600 --> 06:00.440
you must survive.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.960
Survival is all that matters.

06:05.880 --> 06:06.840
Grandfather,

06:08.480 --> 06:10.080
please forgive me.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.560
I truly did not know

06:16.880 --> 06:18.280
there were still things in this world

06:19.480 --> 06:20.960
worth caring for.

06:21.720 --> 06:24.480
I want you to live.

06:25.520 --> 06:30.240
You are the smartest
and most talented man in our family.

06:31.560 --> 06:36.560
The Zhao family will only have hope
if you remain alive.

06:38.280 --> 06:39.120
Get up!

06:40.600 --> 06:41.480
Get up!

06:42.000 --> 06:43.520
- Remember!
- Let him go!

06:43.600 --> 06:45.440
Staying alive is your top priority!

06:45.520 --> 06:47.040
Come at me if you want!

06:47.720 --> 06:51.080
Bai Sheng, do not think
that I do not know you are behind this!

06:51.160 --> 06:53.760
I know you are here! Show yourself!

07:00.120 --> 07:03.760
Mr. Zhao, I hope you have been well.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.320
Nanzhao's Prince Bai.

07:07.320 --> 07:09.440
No wonder you could spend so much money.

07:11.240 --> 07:13.600
You only wanted someone
who could weave brocade.

07:14.600 --> 07:16.480
You could have just taken me with you.

07:17.200 --> 07:20.720
Why did you capture my whole family?

07:24.200 --> 07:25.760
Many believe that

07:26.400 --> 07:29.040
you care for only one person.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.160
Yet,

07:30.880 --> 07:32.520
I think you truly care

07:33.320 --> 07:36.240
for the entire Zhao family.

07:36.760 --> 07:39.840
But there is something
you have wrongly accused me of.

07:39.920 --> 07:43.880
Of all your family,
it is only you that I desire.

07:43.960 --> 07:46.960
It is your fault for being so talented.

07:48.240 --> 07:49.960
As for the others…

07:51.320 --> 07:52.680
Deputy General Niu

07:53.360 --> 07:55.320
will surely find other uses for them.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.200
What do you want to do?

08:02.280 --> 08:04.360
What do you think?

08:09.720 --> 08:11.160
Why ask the obvious?

08:14.920 --> 08:17.360
When we reach Nanzhao,

08:18.640 --> 08:20.800
you will see Ji Yingying.

08:23.000 --> 08:28.520
My promise to you will then
be considered fulfilled.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.039
She will not leave with you.

08:37.720 --> 08:40.360
Every wolf is stubborn

08:41.159 --> 08:42.480
before it is tamed.

08:43.919 --> 08:47.680
As for me, whether I can tame her

08:49.800 --> 08:51.520
will depend on my own skill.

08:56.720 --> 08:58.080
She is not a wolf.

08:58.600 --> 09:01.800
You are. You are the wolf.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.880
Ms. Ji,

09:11.000 --> 09:11.920
I did not let you down.

09:12.000 --> 09:14.240
Mr. Yang is safe now.

09:18.800 --> 09:19.720
Good.

09:20.240 --> 09:21.120
Very good.

09:24.560 --> 09:25.400
Thank you.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.040
You are welcome.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.560
I wonder how Yizhou fares at this moment.

09:31.760 --> 09:33.800
I have come to an agreement
with the main brocade merchants

09:33.880 --> 09:36.520
to protect our own workers
and remain indoors.

09:37.520 --> 09:39.360
But when I entered the city earlier,

09:39.440 --> 09:41.880
I learned that Mr. Zhao Senior
and their entire household

09:41.960 --> 09:43.080
have vanished without a trace.

09:43.160 --> 09:44.440
Vanished?

09:44.520 --> 09:45.400
Yes.

09:46.760 --> 09:49.640
Mr. Zhao Senior would not
break his promise in this matter.

09:50.200 --> 09:53.680
Unless… he is no longer able
to make his own decisions.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.600
I will send men
to investigate this at once.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.520
No.

09:59.880 --> 10:02.360
The ones with the power
to move an entire family

10:02.880 --> 10:05.040
are not our match.

10:08.560 --> 10:12.240
Mr. Zhuge, please inform Governor Zhang
about this immediately.

10:12.320 --> 10:13.920
Request that he send soldiers
to investigate.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.280
If necessary,

10:15.360 --> 10:17.840
they must report this
to the commissioner without delay.

10:17.920 --> 10:19.480
Alright. Do not worry.

10:19.560 --> 10:20.920
Leave this to me.

10:24.720 --> 10:27.360
The city is no longer safe.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.840
Let our warriors have a good meal tonight.

10:54.360 --> 10:55.200
Yes.

11:02.360 --> 11:06.000
Victory or defeat
will be determined by this one move.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.120
Ji Yingying,

11:28.640 --> 11:31.000
your moon longs to be in place

11:31.080 --> 11:33.760
where it can meet your gaze
the moment you look up.

11:36.960 --> 11:39.880
The Zhao family was wiped out overnight.

11:39.960 --> 11:42.120
How many men were needed
to accomplish this?

11:43.120 --> 11:45.520
Zhuge Hong, write this up at once.

11:45.600 --> 11:46.640
I am going to meet the commissioner
in person.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.880
- Yes, sir.
- Move faster!

11:54.560 --> 11:56.160
- Governor!
- Protect the governor!

11:58.680 --> 12:00.480
That person is from Nanzhao! Chase him!

12:17.400 --> 12:20.520
It is an honor
to be chosen by His Highness.

12:21.600 --> 12:23.000
Those whose names are on this list…

12:23.080 --> 12:23.920
LIST

12:24.000 --> 12:25.520
…are given two choices.

12:26.680 --> 12:29.240
You will either come with us, or…

12:30.760 --> 12:32.760
I will kill off those not selected
by His Highness

12:33.360 --> 12:34.920
and take you with me.

12:40.000 --> 12:42.800
Those whose names I call
should stand behind me.

12:44.160 --> 12:46.040
Yingxi Dyehouse's Mr. Chen.

12:54.320 --> 12:56.240
Liuyue Dyehouse's Mr. Jiang.

13:00.320 --> 13:02.680
Luoxia Dyehouse's Ms. Zhu.

13:10.400 --> 13:12.480
Cailuan Dyehouse's Mr. Sheng.

13:21.920 --> 13:24.040
Cailuan Dyehouse's Mr. Sheng.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.080
Mr. Sheng is…

13:26.680 --> 13:28.080
Do not tell me he is not here.

13:29.480 --> 13:32.800
Since Ji Yingying has gathered you here
to protect you all together,

13:33.600 --> 13:35.560
none shall be left behind.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.920
Cowardly personality.

13:45.440 --> 13:47.160
Often seen carrying medicine around.

13:48.680 --> 13:51.040
Likes to bring up his mother's teachings.

13:52.680 --> 13:53.840
Take him.

13:57.560 --> 13:58.640
Next.

13:59.360 --> 14:01.360
Yaoyue Dyehouse's Mr. Liu.

14:02.800 --> 14:05.440
- What are you planning to do?
- Huacai Dyehouse's Feng Dalang.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.720
Feng Sanlang.

14:08.400 --> 14:09.480
I do not know.

14:11.360 --> 14:14.840
You asked me why I have feelings for you
and how long they will last.

14:16.160 --> 14:17.320
I do not know.

14:19.000 --> 14:22.360
All I know is that I cannot leave you.

14:23.760 --> 14:26.880
I want to be with you
no matter where you go.

14:31.720 --> 14:32.920
The last one.

14:33.440 --> 14:34.520
Ji's Brocade Workshop,

14:34.600 --> 14:36.000
Ji Yaoting.

14:36.080 --> 14:37.040
BROCADE HOUSE OF JI FAMILY, JI YAO TING
THE ELDEST SON OF THE JI FAMILY

14:37.760 --> 14:38.600
Ting…

14:39.360 --> 14:42.320
Mother, they only want us
to weave brocade for them.

14:42.400 --> 14:44.160
They are not after our lives.

14:44.240 --> 14:47.200
It is only through our survival
that we shall be reunited once more.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.040
Ting…

14:49.120 --> 14:50.920
Mother, fret not. All shall be well.

14:56.920 --> 14:58.440
Mr. Ji, stay a moment.

15:08.160 --> 15:11.160
His Highness is concerned
that Mrs. Ji's delicate health

15:11.240 --> 15:12.520
may not bear such a shock.

15:13.280 --> 15:15.600
Should she be troubled, His Highness
would surely incur Ms. Ji's ire.

15:15.680 --> 15:18.560
Thus, he wishes for you to remain with her
for the time being and tend to her needs.

15:18.640 --> 15:21.880
You may proceed to His Highness
with Ms. Ji later.

15:22.560 --> 15:23.480
Oh, yes.

15:26.600 --> 15:29.720
His Highness has a message for Ms. Ji,
which he bids you to convey.

15:38.480 --> 15:43.480
THE YANG RESIDENCE

15:43.560 --> 15:44.840
Ma'am.

15:46.440 --> 15:49.800
Breakfast is served.
Please have some food.

15:52.040 --> 15:54.200
I am no longer Mr. Yang's wife now.

15:54.800 --> 15:57.680
It is not appropriate to call me that.

16:00.200 --> 16:03.600
You will be again when Mr. Yang gets back.

16:04.920 --> 16:06.400
Take care of your health.

16:06.920 --> 16:08.480
Please have some food.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.560
Come.

16:19.280 --> 16:20.120
Let me help you.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.440
Yingying.

16:26.120 --> 16:28.000
- Yingying!
- Mother!

16:28.760 --> 16:30.680
- Yingying.
- Yaoting!

16:33.520 --> 16:34.720
I am sorry.

16:35.920 --> 16:36.960
I was too late.

16:39.560 --> 16:41.160
After they were taken away,

16:41.240 --> 16:44.560
I dispatched men to trail them in secret,
hoping to uncover their stronghold.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.760
But we still ended up losing them.

16:50.240 --> 16:53.080
What is the message that Sheng Fengze
bade you to deliver to me?

16:53.800 --> 16:57.880
He said that Ji Yingying alone
is worth hundreds of craftsmen.

17:01.040 --> 17:02.840
I would rather we forgo this deal.

17:05.400 --> 17:08.240
Yingying! Listen to me.

17:09.119 --> 17:11.800
Savages are not to be trusted.

17:11.880 --> 17:14.200
Even if you were to go to him,
they would still not release the others.

17:15.280 --> 17:16.760
He is indeed untrustworthy.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.520
However, Mother,

17:18.599 --> 17:21.160
it is only by going myself
that I can gather more information.

17:21.240 --> 17:22.440
Only then will I be able
to negotiate with him.

17:22.520 --> 17:25.319
- I can then…
- I know! I know all that.

17:27.359 --> 17:28.480
My daughter

17:29.000 --> 17:29.840
is very strong.

17:29.920 --> 17:31.400
You are loyal to your people.

17:31.920 --> 17:36.760
But I cannot bear to see you
take such risks for others.

17:37.280 --> 17:39.400
All I ask is that you remain
safe and sound.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.000
Mother,

17:41.800 --> 17:43.400
they are not others.

17:44.120 --> 17:46.360
They are my friends, who have
stood by me through thick and thin.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.280
Sheng Fengze is a psychopath

17:49.360 --> 17:51.480
who will stop at nothing
to achieve his goal.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.000
His letting Yaoting stay behind

17:54.080 --> 17:56.760
is both a gesture of sincerity
and a threat.

17:57.560 --> 18:00.480
If I do not go,
he will devise an even more cruel plan.

18:06.120 --> 18:08.680
Ms. Ji,
there is a carriage at the entrance.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.080
Who is it?

18:12.160 --> 18:15.640
The carriage was empty,
but I did find this.

18:24.560 --> 18:25.480
Leave us.

18:26.120 --> 18:26.960
Yes.

18:31.680 --> 18:33.000
This belongs to Pin.

18:33.080 --> 18:33.920
Pin…

18:35.560 --> 18:38.280
That carriage was sent
by Sheng Fengze to pick me up.

18:46.560 --> 18:49.800
Mother, I must go.

18:53.080 --> 18:54.280
I will go with you.

18:57.040 --> 18:58.320
As you said,

18:58.400 --> 19:00.840
he is a psychopath who will stop
at nothing until he achieves his goal.

19:00.920 --> 19:02.440
And he wanted both of us from the start.

19:02.520 --> 19:04.280
Why should I stay behind
and make things worse?

19:06.240 --> 19:07.200
Besides,

19:08.960 --> 19:11.200
I know you will not simply let this go.

19:12.240 --> 19:15.680
If your plan succeeds,
I will escape with you if I can.

19:15.760 --> 19:16.640
And if…

19:19.920 --> 19:21.760
we are unfortunate enough to be caught
and made to work as coolies,

19:23.280 --> 19:24.920
I will be there to look out for you.

19:37.720 --> 19:40.120
Mother, please give us your permission.

19:53.880 --> 19:55.520
Mother, please give us your permission.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.640
- Farewell, Mother.
- Farewell, Mother.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.400
Let's go.

21:02.320 --> 21:08.880
THE YANG RESIDENCE

21:08.960 --> 21:09.840
Ms. Ji,

21:10.440 --> 21:11.920
is there anything I can do?

21:12.800 --> 21:14.480
I will have guards follow us in secret

21:14.560 --> 21:15.960
and leave messages for you
whenever possible.

21:16.040 --> 21:18.920
I hope you can track down
those craftsmen by following our trail.

21:19.000 --> 21:19.920
Understood.

21:20.440 --> 21:25.000
One more thing. I am still uneasy about
the disappearance of the Zhao family.

21:25.840 --> 21:27.400
The governor was attacked.

21:27.480 --> 21:31.240
I hope you can assist Chief Sang
in uncovering the truth swiftly

21:31.760 --> 21:33.040
and restore peace to Yizhou.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.320
Understood. Leave it to me.

21:35.400 --> 21:37.800
I will do the best I can
to protect Yizhou.

21:37.880 --> 21:40.600
Ms. Ji, you two must take care.

21:42.440 --> 21:44.160
- Farewell.
- Farewell.

21:50.520 --> 21:53.120
Yingying, the carriage
does not even have a groom.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.240
Where are we heading to?

21:54.840 --> 21:55.760
Yaoting,

22:00.320 --> 22:01.960
we cannot let him manipulate us.

22:32.200 --> 22:33.080
Your Highness.

22:35.840 --> 22:38.760
Our carriage is back. But it is empty.

22:38.840 --> 22:40.640
There is only a note.

22:49.960 --> 22:53.080
I took hostages. She chose the location.

22:53.720 --> 22:57.240
We each have a card up our sleeve.
This is only fair.

22:57.320 --> 22:59.720
Ji Yingying has always been very cunning.

23:00.240 --> 23:03.120
She must have set up a trap
to lure you into the city.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.760
This is a trap.

23:04.840 --> 23:06.200
You must not go.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.800
Do you think he will really come?

23:22.720 --> 23:23.960
He is so confident.

23:24.040 --> 23:25.760
Everything is going according to his plan.

23:25.840 --> 23:27.040
Why would he not come?

23:28.160 --> 23:31.880
I suppose Ms. Ji still knows me the best.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.320
Long time no see.

23:36.480 --> 23:40.720
Sadly, there are only
two chairs in my courtyard.

23:40.800 --> 23:42.320
I am not able to have extra guests.

23:44.680 --> 23:46.880
Mr. Ji, please.

23:48.520 --> 23:50.840
Yaoting, wait for me outside.

23:52.880 --> 23:54.120
You must be careful.

24:03.320 --> 24:05.000
Ms. Ji, please.

24:09.320 --> 24:11.680
How many people do you think
I can exchange for?

24:15.600 --> 24:17.320
How many do you think?

24:17.920 --> 24:18.880
Half.

24:19.520 --> 24:21.320
Half of the craftsmen you captured.

24:24.000 --> 24:26.720
This price is rather steep.

24:27.600 --> 24:31.000
I am offering myself in exchange
for those who already belong to Yizhou.

24:31.520 --> 24:34.280
You know well who has profited from this.

24:35.200 --> 24:37.360
The amount I have spent
to capture these people…

24:37.440 --> 24:41.440
On average, it should be
about 100 gold pieces each.

24:42.120 --> 24:45.920
I could have caught more
to spread my costs thinner.

24:46.600 --> 24:48.600
Who would have thought that you,
Ms. Ji, would be so clever?

24:48.680 --> 24:49.600
Aside from the Zhao family,

24:49.680 --> 24:52.800
you managed to hide the others
without leaving a trace.

24:52.880 --> 24:55.440
No. I was still too slow.

24:57.080 --> 24:58.760
From the moment you stole the pattern…

24:59.360 --> 25:01.480
From the moment
Mianzhou's brocade workshop was set up…

25:02.000 --> 25:03.480
I should have sensed something was amiss.

25:20.000 --> 25:22.000
Exactly how many craftsmen
am I able to exchange for?

25:25.320 --> 25:27.040
I think

25:27.120 --> 25:30.240
we should call it a business deal
rather than a hostage exchange.

25:31.280 --> 25:34.200
Since you can lead merchants
thousands of miles

25:34.280 --> 25:35.440
to Tubo to sell brocade,

25:35.520 --> 25:38.920
surely you can also lead craftsmen
to Nanzhao to weave brocade.

25:39.800 --> 25:40.800
Perhaps

25:40.880 --> 25:43.600
this is just another way
to expand trade routes.

25:44.840 --> 25:46.720
This is not an expansion of trade routes.

25:47.760 --> 25:49.840
This is capturing us as slaves

25:49.920 --> 25:52.440
and forcing us to admit
that we stayed willingly.

25:53.840 --> 25:54.840
Look at you!

25:54.920 --> 25:57.960
You are fully aware that you are the prey,
and I am the hunter.

25:58.040 --> 26:01.320
What more is there for you
to negotiate with me?

26:02.360 --> 26:03.680
If I truly had nothing,

26:04.360 --> 26:07.120
why would you bother
negotiating with me here?

26:07.920 --> 26:10.240
You could easily tie me up
and take me with you.

26:12.160 --> 26:13.640
Let me amend my terms.

26:14.640 --> 26:16.520
Release three groups of people.

26:18.120 --> 26:19.200
Keep talking.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.440
Those who are above 50 years old.

26:22.520 --> 26:24.040
Those who are weak and sickly.

26:24.120 --> 26:25.920
Those who have elderly parents.

26:26.440 --> 26:28.560
Elderly parents?

26:29.080 --> 26:30.800
That is not the minority.

26:32.520 --> 26:35.920
How about those with elderly parents
and are also an only child?

26:36.000 --> 26:37.200
Release them.

26:42.240 --> 26:44.960
Very well. I will agree to your terms.

26:47.760 --> 26:49.960
However, you must pay the deposit first

26:50.040 --> 26:51.520
before I can feel secure
in releasing them.

26:54.040 --> 26:55.960
Oh, Ms. Ji!

26:56.040 --> 26:59.360
You still are not sincere
in working with me.

27:10.040 --> 27:11.160
What did you do?

27:11.240 --> 27:12.840
Yizhou

27:14.480 --> 27:15.480
is about to fall into chaos.

27:21.920 --> 27:23.240
Kill!

27:25.680 --> 27:26.800
Sheng Fengze!

27:30.600 --> 27:31.680
No.

27:31.760 --> 27:34.560
Your lot from Nanzhao
could never muster this on your own.

27:34.640 --> 27:36.400
Where did you gather so many men?

27:36.480 --> 27:37.960
You are so clever, Ms. Ji.

27:38.040 --> 27:40.800
You should be able to guess
who I am working with.

27:41.520 --> 27:42.640
Niu Jin.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.760
Kill!

27:53.160 --> 27:54.120
Kill!

28:02.000 --> 28:03.160
Close the doors!

28:07.040 --> 28:08.120
- Your Highness,
- Yaoting!

28:08.200 --> 28:09.240
Niu Jin never made it to Yizhou.

28:09.840 --> 28:11.880
Instead, he waylaid
the Commissioner en route

28:11.960 --> 28:14.520
and now lays waste to the city,
masquerading as forces of Nanzhao.

28:15.240 --> 28:16.720
I suppose it's an utter chaos out there.

28:16.800 --> 28:18.720
I fear you yourself might be in peril.

28:18.800 --> 28:21.640
I fear your dealings have gone awry.

28:22.520 --> 28:24.080
Not only have you slaughtered
the common folk of Yizhou,

28:24.160 --> 28:26.800
you now bear the blame for assassinating
Yizhou's commissioner as well.

28:27.400 --> 28:30.040
If he intends for me
to shoulder all these crimes,

28:30.120 --> 28:33.240
his surest course would be
to silence me with death.

28:34.600 --> 28:36.840
Nanzhao traitor, Sheng Fengze!

28:36.920 --> 28:37.880
Open the door!

28:40.520 --> 28:42.120
Charge with all your might!

28:45.880 --> 28:46.800
Come!

28:49.680 --> 28:51.320
You know better than I do!

28:51.400 --> 28:55.440
Once Niu Jin's men break in,
no one inside will be left alive.

29:02.520 --> 29:04.920
Nanzhao traitor! Chase after him!

29:34.240 --> 29:35.080
Kill them!

29:39.920 --> 29:42.760
YIZHOU GOVERNOR'S RESIDENCE

29:42.840 --> 29:43.840
Get inside!

29:43.920 --> 29:46.200
You will be safe
once you are inside! Hurry!

30:00.640 --> 30:03.960
You are alright. Don't cry.
Your father and mother will come for you.

30:04.560 --> 30:05.640
You must be strong.

30:06.640 --> 30:07.680
Guards!

30:08.680 --> 30:10.480
- Bring him in.
- Come on, little boy.

30:11.000 --> 30:13.080
- Go!
- Hurry up!

30:13.920 --> 30:15.080
Yang Jinglan!

30:15.160 --> 30:16.440
Yang Jinglan!

30:18.600 --> 30:20.800
Yaoting! How are you? Where is Yingying?

30:20.880 --> 30:22.640
Yingying… Yingying
got taken away by Bai Sheng.

30:23.240 --> 30:24.520
Niu Jin's men are still after them.

30:24.600 --> 30:26.560
But… But I do not know
where they are headed!

30:26.640 --> 30:28.200
Bai Sheng… When was this?

30:28.920 --> 30:30.160
Just a moment ago.

30:32.640 --> 30:34.600
Yaoting, it will be alright.

30:34.680 --> 30:36.120
I will bring Yingying home safely.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.800
Take care of yourself. I am off!

30:39.400 --> 30:41.160
You must be careful!

30:49.840 --> 30:53.200
The Nanzhao traitor
dares to assassinate the commissioner!

30:53.720 --> 30:57.640
I, Niu Jin, swear upon this sword today

30:57.720 --> 30:59.480
to defend the peace of Yizhou

30:59.560 --> 31:01.840
and share the same fate as its people.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.760
Attack!

31:03.280 --> 31:06.200
General, this city
is teeming with our own men.

31:06.280 --> 31:08.520
- Are we going to kill them all?
- Our men?

31:09.040 --> 31:10.600
Are not those who ravaged
the people of Yizhou

31:10.680 --> 31:12.160
soldiers of Nanzhao?

31:12.680 --> 31:16.160
Every one who plundered Yizhou's folk
shall be wiped out!

31:17.160 --> 31:21.440
Let no Nanzhao traitor survive! Attack!

31:47.560 --> 31:49.200
Those who are above 50 years old,

31:50.520 --> 31:52.160
those who are weak and sickly,

31:52.760 --> 31:54.000
and those are are an only child

31:54.080 --> 31:57.080
who have elderly parents…

31:58.320 --> 32:01.200
The people you want me to release
are all here.

32:02.560 --> 32:05.160
There are hundreds and thousands
of Yizhou craftsmen captured.

32:05.680 --> 32:08.320
I do not need to count them to know
that this cannot be all.

32:09.480 --> 32:13.280
Those have likely already reached Nanzhao.

32:13.360 --> 32:16.200
I cannot release them,
even if I wished to.

32:16.280 --> 32:17.520
Sheng Fengze.

32:19.200 --> 32:22.400
I will honor the promises I made to you.

32:23.000 --> 32:25.600
If you choose to break your word,

32:26.520 --> 32:30.960
I cannot guarantee
the safe return of these peopleto Yizhou.

32:40.400 --> 32:43.200
Yizhou's brocade
shall be passed down through the ages.

32:44.400 --> 32:48.840
As long as you remain,
the brocade shall endure.

32:54.000 --> 32:59.240
- Ms. Ji, thank you!
- Ms. Ji, thank you!

33:04.520 --> 33:05.720
Please rise.

33:13.320 --> 33:14.200
Yingying!

33:38.480 --> 33:40.080
Yang Jinglan!

34:05.480 --> 34:06.640
Yang Jinglan,

34:06.720 --> 34:10.040
with the universe as our mediator
and the land as our witness,

34:10.120 --> 34:13.120
I, Ji Yingying,
take you as my husband today.

34:13.199 --> 34:16.600
By fate, we are reunited,
never to be parted again.

34:24.400 --> 34:25.600
Ji Yingying,

34:26.280 --> 34:29.360
with the universe as our mediator
and the land as our witness,

34:31.040 --> 34:32.080
I, Yang Jinglan,

34:33.040 --> 34:35.080
take you as my wife today.

34:36.199 --> 34:37.880
Even if we are seas apart,

34:39.400 --> 34:41.040
I will always bring you back home!

36:51.640 --> 36:53.840
Commissioner Mu
has tragically fallen in battle.

36:53.920 --> 36:55.720
Nanzhao's Prince Bai
harbors great ambition.

36:55.800 --> 36:57.880
He may return at any moment.

36:58.480 --> 37:00.960
To safeguard the people of Yizhou

37:01.040 --> 37:02.560
and avenge Commissioner Mu,

37:02.640 --> 37:07.040
I offer myself to temporarily assume
the role of commissioner.

37:07.120 --> 37:08.600
Are there any who oppose?

37:12.760 --> 37:14.560
The commissioner should be appointed
by the government.

37:15.160 --> 37:17.840
General Niu,
your actions seem most unseemly!

37:20.520 --> 37:23.440
Niu Jin!
How dare you kill generals without cause?

37:23.520 --> 37:28.040
Today, I shall uphold the military rules
in the name of the commissioner!

37:33.840 --> 37:36.640
I shall temporarily assume
the role of commissioner.

37:37.160 --> 37:39.120
Are there any who object?

37:45.680 --> 37:48.200
Greetings, Commissioner Niu!

37:48.280 --> 37:50.400
Greetings, Commissioner Niu!

37:50.480 --> 37:52.760
Greetings, Commissioner Niu!

37:53.840 --> 37:58.040
THE NIU RESIDENCE

37:58.120 --> 38:02.120
Commander, someone saw Yang Jinglan
entering the city during the battle.

38:02.800 --> 38:04.880
Will he affect our plans?

38:08.120 --> 38:09.040
No.

38:10.480 --> 38:12.080
Mu Hui is dead.

38:12.160 --> 38:15.920
I have taken command of Jian'nan's troops
and entered Yizhou with my army.

38:16.560 --> 38:20.200
The government has no choice
but to acknowledge me as commissioner now.

38:20.280 --> 38:22.440
Yang Jinglan is powerless to stop me.

38:26.280 --> 38:28.440
But Sheng Fengze…

38:31.320 --> 38:33.120
Get our men to send word to Nanzhao.

38:34.360 --> 38:35.440
Yes, sir.

38:48.960 --> 38:51.960
Commissioner Mu learned
that Nanzhao's men had entered the city

38:52.760 --> 38:54.640
and hastened to send cavalry.

38:55.320 --> 38:56.200
However,

38:57.600 --> 38:59.400
he fell into Niu Jin's ambush.

39:00.000 --> 39:02.720
Lieutenant General Li betrayed us
and joined forces with Niu Jin.

39:03.800 --> 39:04.960
The commissioner's troops

39:07.480 --> 39:09.040
were all wiped out.

39:12.360 --> 39:15.080
Commissioner Wu
gave his life to ensure my escape.

39:16.600 --> 39:18.800
Many other brave warriors
aided me along the way,

39:19.320 --> 39:20.800
and that is how I narrowly survived.

39:22.600 --> 39:24.840
There is one more thing you may not know.

39:26.240 --> 39:29.160
It was not the Nanzhao troops
who attacked Yizhou.

39:29.240 --> 39:30.880
It was Niu Jin who masterminded it all.

39:32.040 --> 39:33.560
There is no justice.

39:34.480 --> 39:36.000
There is no justice!

39:37.520 --> 39:40.840
These two fake Nanzhao soldiers
were captured by me amid the chaos.

39:41.480 --> 39:43.280
General Xue,
you may take them to the capital

39:43.360 --> 39:44.520
as proof of this treachery.

39:44.600 --> 39:45.840
Very well.

39:47.160 --> 39:48.720
I shall make my way to Chang'an.

39:49.280 --> 39:50.960
Even at the cost of my life,

39:51.560 --> 39:53.440
I will ensure that Niu Jin's heinous deeds

39:53.520 --> 39:55.240
are laid bare before all the realm.

39:55.320 --> 39:58.440
I will petition His Majesty
to rid the empire of these traitors.

40:00.600 --> 40:01.640
Mr. Yang,

40:02.400 --> 40:05.600
Jian'nan is overrun with Niu Jin's people.

40:06.120 --> 40:08.880
Why not come with me to Chang'an?

40:09.920 --> 40:12.800
Once the government issues
the command to bring down Niu Jin,

40:12.880 --> 40:16.600
I shall lead the troops to Nanzhao
and rescue your wife.

40:18.000 --> 40:20.720
Your plan is indeed sound.

40:20.800 --> 40:24.560
However, it will take time for
the government to move against Niu Jin.

40:25.320 --> 40:28.080
My wife is currently surrounded
by the enemy,

40:29.040 --> 40:31.480
and I cannot afford to wait.
Nor will I wait any longer.

40:33.920 --> 40:36.040
I am familiar with Nanzhao.
I will go with you.

40:37.520 --> 40:40.400
The fewer who sneak into Nanzhao,
the better.

40:41.080 --> 40:43.040
You mean the fewer who go,
the fewer will perish.

40:43.560 --> 40:46.120
Sheng Fengze
is a wily and treacherous scoundrel.

40:46.640 --> 40:48.480
How is your journey to Nanzhao any
different from walking into hell itself?

40:48.560 --> 40:50.040
The difference is that

40:50.120 --> 40:53.400
you will ensure the safe passage
of General Xue and Zhuge to Chang'an.

40:53.480 --> 40:56.520
We will work together.
You will assist my escape from Nanzhao.

40:58.000 --> 40:59.440
You always have a way with words.

40:59.520 --> 41:00.800
I can never win
in any argument against you!

41:01.520 --> 41:02.640
I will stay.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.040
Stay where?

41:06.120 --> 41:07.400
I will stay in Yizhou.

41:10.440 --> 41:11.480
Zhuge…

41:12.440 --> 41:13.800
I know what you want to say.

41:13.880 --> 41:16.440
Firstly, the journey to Chang'an
is fraught with peril,

41:16.520 --> 41:17.760
and I'm without the skills of a warrior.

41:17.840 --> 41:19.400
I do not wish to be a burden to you.

41:19.480 --> 41:23.000
Secondly, those brocade families
who were not captured by Nanzhao

41:23.080 --> 41:24.720
will surely return to Yizhou.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.240
Yizhou cannot stand
without the Shu brocade,

41:26.320 --> 41:28.160
nor can it do without a brocade officer.

41:29.160 --> 41:32.720
Thirdly, when you return
to set matters right in Yizhou,

41:32.800 --> 41:35.640
you will need someone within the city
to act from the inside.

41:36.440 --> 41:39.280
It is, therefore, most prudent for me
to remain behind.

41:40.120 --> 41:42.560
Yang Jinglan,
I am no longer your subordinate.

41:42.640 --> 41:44.480
You have no right to command me.

41:44.560 --> 41:47.440
Indeed, you are no longer my subordinate,

41:47.960 --> 41:49.120
but as a friend,

41:49.200 --> 41:52.160
I beseech you to exercise caution.

41:52.240 --> 41:53.520
Work within your means.

41:54.880 --> 41:55.800
I will.

41:56.400 --> 41:59.080
Very well. Let us each go our own way.

41:59.160 --> 42:01.400
In due time,
we shall meet again in Yizhou.

42:30.840 --> 42:33.040
Ms. Ji, why are you not asking me today?

42:35.680 --> 42:37.520
It is not that I am unwilling to speak,

42:37.600 --> 42:40.480
but we are leagues away from Yizhou.

42:40.560 --> 42:43.760
Even if I were to tell you,
it would be of no use.

42:43.840 --> 42:46.760
There is no need to add to your burdens.

42:51.960 --> 42:53.680
Where are Ms. Zhu and the others?

42:55.040 --> 42:57.520
They traveled faster than we did
and should have arrived by now.

42:57.600 --> 42:59.240
Perhaps they have already settled.
